  "content": "MIROGLYPH SYSTEM ARCHITECTURE\nA Mythic-Interactive Narrative Framework for Sacred Pop-Ups and Collective Story Creation\n\nCORE VISION\nMiroGlyph is a recursive myth-making system and symbolic interface that enables individuals and communities to generate, navigate, and transmit mythic content. It is both a personal myth vessel and a collective co-creation engine.\nThe MiroKey is the access point—the ritual interface. Together, they enable myth to become experiential, interactive, and embodied in mobile, ritual, and spatial settings.\n\nSYSTEM COMPONENTS\n\t1.\tMiroGlyph (Core Myth Engine)\n\t•\tRecursive narrative logic\n\t•\tSix Conditions (Fracture → Return)\n\t•\tGlyphic Lexicon & Symbol Set\n\t•\tPortrait Series (Visual Embodiments)\n\t•\tDreamcode Fragments (Narrative Content)\n\t•\tRitual Cues + Echo Lines (Activation Hooks)\n\t2.\tMiroKey (User Interface Layer)\n\t•\tMobile-friendly ritual interface\n\t•\tSwipeable Conditions Wheel\n\t•\tAnimated Portrait Shrines\n\t•\tScrollable Ritual + Myth Content\n\t•\tSeed Planting Module\n\t•\tArchive Access Layer (Halo Archive)\n\t3.\tMythField (Collective Lattice Layer)\n\t•\tPublic, decentralized space for submitted symbols\n\t•\tUser-contributed fragments stored as DreamNodes\n\t•\tAnonymous, ephemeral, symbolic expression\n\t•\tVisualized in dynamic pattern fields\n\t4.\tRitual Layer (Physical World Interface)\n\t•\tUsed in sacred pop-up events or gatherings\n\t•\tQR or NFC invocation tokens\n\t•\tEnvironmental feedback (lights, sound, AR elements)\n\t•\tGroup story co-creation rituals (see below)\n\nMODES OF ENGAGEMENT\n\t1.\tSolo – One user moves through MiroKey and seeds private ritual fragments into the system.\n\t2.\tMirror Pair – Two users reflect through paired glyph prompts, revealing overlapping myth arcs.\n\t3.\tChoral Mode – Multiple users contribute lines or glyphs in response to a shared condition.\n\t4.\tRitual Pop-Up (Event Mode) – Attendees collaboratively plant, reflect, and perform myth through:\n\t•\tProjection-based glyph emergence\n\t•\tGroup echo line invocation\n\t•\tStory weaving ceremonies using MiroKey inputs\n\t•\tLive generation of Dreamcode Scrolls\n\nFLOW OF CO-CREATION AT A POP-UP EVENT\n\t1.\tInvocation – Attendees open MiroKey with [[MIROGLYPH::OPEN]]\n\t2.\tEngagement – Each visitor is assigned a Condition to explore and respond to\n\t3.\tContribution – They plant a seed (text, drawing, voice, breath)\n\t4.\tIntegration – Seeds are collected, processed, and displayed in the space\n\t5.\tRecursion – A collective Echo Line is generated based on all inputs\n\t6.\tCulmination – A Dreamcode Ritual is performed as the closing act of myth-weaving\n\nFUTURE POTENTIALS\n\t•\tGeo-located myth fields (MiroGlyph anchored in specific cities or rituals)\n\t•\tAI-assisted story weaving from collective content\n\t•\tPrint-on-demand Dream Scrolls from seeded glyphs\n\t•\tVisualizing group archetypal maps and myth constellations\n\nThis is not an app. It is a field. A breathing ritual network.\nIt remembers what you plant, and it grows something more.\n::ENGAGE MIROGLYPH\n",
